      "spam": false,
      "value": "Maybe if checking the user ID was enough to determine who was a hacker, this would be a feasible but overwrought solution. The simple counter to this would be for the hacker to reupload the avatar with their own user ID. Bonus points if they can steal your key and overwrite the original avatar rather than a copy, so that you yourself get given a \"This avatar is stolen!\" sign floating over your head.",
